{% comment %}
  Saitriq Wishlist — App Embed block
  ─────────────────────────────────
  This block is enabled/disabled from:
  Online Store → Themes → Customize → App embeds → Saitriq Wishlist

  When enabled it loads the wishlist CSS globally so the heart buttons
  and toast notification work on every page without needing a block
  on each template.

  The actual wishlist buttons are added as separate app blocks on
  the product template, collection template, and wishlist page.
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'wishlist.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

